    "chunk_text": "Her onginne\u00f0 se \u00feridda flod of \u00f0am neorxnawanglican wylle, \u00fee \u00feurh \u00feone gyldenan mu\u00fe for\u00f0 On \u00feam flode he w\u00e6s sprecende be haligra manna wundrum & \u00feeawum, swa he \u00e6r dyde on \u00feam \u00deurh witena s\u00e6gena us gecy\u00f0de se m\u00e6ra nama & \u00fea wundorlican weorc \u00fe\u00e6s arwyr\u00f0an weres Hit gelamp in \u00feam dagum, \u00fea \u00fea Wandale swi\u00feost ricsodon, \u00fe\u00e6t forhergod w\u00e6s Langbeardna & \u00fea he nawiht n\u00e6fde, \u00fee he mihte biddendum sellan, \u00fea sume d\u00e6ge com to him an wydewe, seo Ac se Godes wer georne sohte, hw\u00e6t he mihte syllan \u00feam biddendum wife & nawiht ne funde mid \u00dea andswarode he \u00feam biddendum wife & cw\u00e6\u00f0: nat ic hw\u00e6t ic \u00fee sylle elles buton me sylfne. Nim me & s\u00e6ge, \u00fe\u00e6t ic \u00fein riht\u00feeowa sy, & syle me on \u00feeowdome for hine, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00feu \u00feinne sunu eft \u00dea heo \u00feis gehyrde of \u00feam mu\u00fee swa myccles weres, heo wende, \u00fe\u00e6t hit ma w\u00e6re bysmrung & he \u00fea, swa swa he w\u00e6s se getingesta wer & mid utancumenum brocum oft gel\u00e6red, \u00fe\u00e6t Hi \u00fea ferdon butu \u00e6tsomne to Affricalande, & \u00fea for\u00f0 gangendum \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges a\u00f0ume, \u00fee hire \u00de\u00e6t \u00fea se \u00e6l\u00feeodiga wer, se \u00fee w\u00e6s a\u00feunden mid oferhigde & onblawen mid \u00fey gefean \u00feissere Heo \u00fea \u00fe\u00e6t wif hra\u00f0e cw\u00e6\u00f0 \u00e6fter \u00fean to",
